# INVWINPB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the assembly
# commands by level.  At level 2, in the item list by location, Record >
# Parts shows item 1's parts, where INS installs item 3; ESC goes back to
# the list in that order.  After File > Log out, at level 1, CTRL-D and
# CTRL-E in the item list show INV's refusal in a message box, and the
# Record menu has Move, Install in, Take out and Split units grayed; INS
# and CTRL-E in item 1's parts show the refusal, its Record menu has
# Install part and Take out grayed, and ENTER still shows a part in the
# item form, which ESC closes; ESC goes back to the item list; the end by
# Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPB.SNP is its snapshot.
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER ALT-C R ALT-C P
S EMPTY
K INS
T 3
K ENTER
S ADDED
K ESC
S BYLOC
K ALT-F L
K STAB
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER CTRL-D
S NODUP
K ENTER CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER ALT-C
S NOOUT
K ESC ESC ALT-C P
S PARTS
K INS
S NOINS
K ENTER CTRL-E
S NOEDITP
K ENTER ALT-C
S NOREMOVE
# ENTER shows the part in the item form, which ESC closes: the parts
# stay, and their Updated date, the day of the run, is in no snapshot
K ESC ESC ENTER ESC
S VIEWED
K ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F X
